@@text Commit 069db1cd (from tools/old_id_check.py): `creativeengineering:strong_phantom_bane` replaced into `creativebrewing:phantom_bane` (better_beacons_potions.json; Phantom Bane is levelless); `removed` entries for `rusticdelight:fruit_beignet`, `kubejs:incomplete_quiche_bacon`, `kubejs:incomplete_quiche_mushroom` (Creative Delight removed.json) and the effect `vinery:jellie` (Creative Brewing removed.json). Any world; no old save.
